# NV-03 — Quan ly nguoi dung

UC: 18-30  
Actors: system administrator, coordinator  
Status: specified; implementation pending.

## Scope

Internal account CRUD, lock/unlock/reset, organization assignment, export/search, action history, masked bank-account metadata and identified external users.

## Acceptance criteria

- Account actions require explicit permission and are audited.
- Disabled users cannot create a new session; existing sessions are revoked.
- Sensitive payment information is encrypted/masked and never placed in URL/toast.
- External identity search respects data scope and disclosure rules.

## Test mapping

`user.repository.spec.ts`, `user-permission.service.spec.ts` (planned).

